Subject: breeding pairs and distance sampling
Message-ID: <L_nNd8aUJeU.g2LdR5vQXiMJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/L_nNd8aUJeU/m/g2LdR5vQXiMJ>
